+## s390x adaptation
+
+The independent s390x distribution pins Node 24.22.3 and launches DSH with `--expose-internals`. Linux subprocesses use a Node-API execve/fcntl bridge and big-endian process memory reads. Wildcard listeners use loopback for internal connections; configure public URL and trusted host for remote access. Authentication and browser trust checks remain enforced.
